164
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:45,000
in each of the regions to talk to people

165
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:47,000
not just about the Scoutmaster Handbook

166
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:50,000
but about the Troop Committee Guidebook

167
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:53,000
and about a lot of the ancillary publications

168
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:55,000
that experienced Scouters have seen

169
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:58,000
but a lot of people don't even realize exist-

170
00:09:58,000 --> 00:10:00,000
Everything from advancement guidelines

171
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:02,000
to passport to high adventure-

172
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:06,000
And a couple of things came out of those efforts.

173
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:08,000
One which was a little bit surprising

174
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:11,000
is more than one person said

175
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:13,000
