177
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:17,000
or they were not even a registered leader

178
00:10:17,000 --> 00:10:20,000
in a troop, so they didn't think the book applied to them,

179
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:23,000
And that's why we ended up going with the title

180
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:25,000
Troop Leader Guidebook, to emphasize

181
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:28,000
that this is really for any adult who works in a troop.

182
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:30,000
And then the other piece of that that came out

183
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:33,000
was a realization that there's a lot of really good stuff

184
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:35,000
in some of those ancillary publications

185
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:38,000
