186
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:41,000
And so part of what we did with Troop Leader Guidebook

187
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:43,000
was try to incorporate some of that content

188
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:46,000
so that you don't have to go look for all those other things

189
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:49,000
on scouts stufforg or on the free shelf

190
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:51,000
at your council office.

191
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:53,000
Then the other piece of it is looking at two volumes.

