00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:59,000
You guys have probably seen the big two volume

194
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:02,000
Handbook for Scoutmasters from the 1930s,

195
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:06,000
for which was divided between program and administration,

196
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:09,000
And we settled here on doing the two volumes

