00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:14,000
that you've seen, where volume one is for that new scout leader,

198
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:17,000
much like the current Scoutmaster Handbook has done

199
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:19,000
for the last several editions,

200
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:21,000
And then volume two would address the needs

201
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:23,000
of a more experienced leader,

202
