00:25:03,000 --> 00:25:06,000
or something he can take off to college with him

549
00:25:06,000 --> 00:25:07,000
or something like that.

550
00:25:07,000 --> 00:25:10,000
That kind of ceremonial recognition I think

551
00:25:10,000 --> 00:25:12,000
is incredibly important

552
00:25:12,000 --> 00:25:16,000
as is just kind of like the really simple,

553
00:25:16,000 --> 00:25:20,000
you did a really great job, pat on the back kind of thing:

