00:25:22,000 --> 00:25:23,000
You did fantastic,

556
00:25:23,000 --> 00:25:26,000
You're going to do great in the next mile too,

557
00:25:26,000 --> 00:25:30,000
That sense of recognition not only for individuals

558
00:25:30,000 --> 00:25:32,000
but for the group settings that we have.

